WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:03.460
<i>Today is the fourth day 
since a gigantic aradama</i>

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:05.670
<i>never seen before in recorded 
history has appeared.</i>

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:07.760
<i>The damage at the center of
 Sagami Bay has expanded.</i>

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:09.600
<i>According to the
 Special Religious Military Unit,</i>

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:13.790
<i>the death toll is currently at 
1,089, while 864 remain missing,</i>

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:16.450
<i>and 15,246 are injured.</i>

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.670
<i>I repeat, the death toll 
is currently at 1,089,</i>

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:24.660
<i>while 864 remain missing, 
and 15,246 are injured.</i>

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:30.020
<i>It has been a approximately an hour since the</i>

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:32.420
<i>Special Religious Military Unit's
special unit began their attack.</i>

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:35.170
Nee-sama...

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:54.480
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:11.850
<b>Episode 8  Day of Disaster</b>

00:02:16.750 --> 00:02:17.850
What should we do?

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:19.520
Yukari, behind you!

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:23.530
Th-Thank you.

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.140
Yukina-chan!

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:28.050
Yukina!

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:29.770
It's no good, she can't use her utsushi anymore.

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:33.610
Yukari-sama...

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:35.410
Yukina...

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:41.960
Minato, Yuzuki-senpai, 
Ema, Iroha-senpai, Sana,

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:44.470
you five take Yukina and retreat!

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:46.240
No, please!

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:51.390
You can't order a retreat because 
of me. Please just let me die here!

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:52.100
Yukina-chan!

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:55.100
I don't want anyone else 
to sacrifice themselves.

00:02:58.920 --> 00:02:59.860
Kagari?

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:04.110
That may be, but it'll be a little 
difficult to retreat, don't you think?

00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:05.510
She's right!

00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:09.200
We have trouble ahead of us and trouble 
behind us. We might as well go forward!

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:14.200
We're so close to it, though.

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:15.540
No, we're not.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:16.080
Huh?

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:19.330
The main body is likely deeper inside.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:21.790
Then let's go and destroy it.

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:26.500
No, Yukari-sama and I will 
go on our own from here.

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:28.010
What? Why?

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:30.480
Wait, hey, what do you mean?

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:35.020
The aradama and Toji have been fighting 
each other for over 400 years.

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:37.970
In all that time, there have
 been three recorded

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:40.350
instances of massive 
disasters caused by the aradama.

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:43.520
Each time, a member of the Origami family, 
along with only one other person,

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:45.150
suppressed them using an inherited technique.

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:46.650
A way to suppress them?

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:47.900
There is one?

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:49.410
There is.

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:51.990
I just need Kagari's help.

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:55.390
This is the first we've heard of it.

00:03:55.390 --> 00:03:57.960
Why didn't you tell us, too?

00:03:58.350 --> 00:04:01.580
There's no time to explain. 
We will follow orders.

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:03.150
Yuzuki-san...

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:05.540
I will take command of the squad from here.

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:08.340
We will protect Yukina and 
retreat as quickly as possible.

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:12.340
No, Yukari-sama... Yukari-oneesama!

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:13.330
Kagari...

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:20.790
Minato, take the lead and 
secure an escape route.

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:23.700
Sorry, Yuzuki-san. I'm gonna go back them up.

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:26.080
Wait! There's nothing you can do if you go.

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:28.150
Ema, take care of things for me.

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:29.200
Minato!

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:31.810
Yukari and Kagari are both exhausted.

00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:33.910
I can at least serve as the outrider.

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:37.150
Got it. Leave everyone to me!

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:37.910
Ema!

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:45.170
You know how Minato is, 
don't you, Yuzuki-senpai?

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:48.010
Exactly, it's a waste of 
time to try and stop her.

00:04:48.340 --> 00:04:49.920
Then I'm going, too.

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:52.840
Sana-chan, things are pretty bad here, too.

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:55.090
Okay!

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:01.590
Are you okay?

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:02.730
Kagari, behind you!

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:08.330
Minato-senpai?

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:10.240
Why?

00:05:10.980 --> 00:05:14.660
I don't understand how, but you can suppress
 that thing if you get to it, right?

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:15.890
Then...

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:21.540
I'll back you up until you do.

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:23.300
Are you crazy?

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:25.750
Do you have any idea why 
Yukari-sama had everyone go back?

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:28.500
If you have time to talk, save your breath.

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:31.510
Why are you always like this?

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:35.010
Kagari, Minato is right. Focus on the fight.

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:38.480
Frankly, you saved us.

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:43.140
But disobeying orders is a serious offense.

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:46.510
Aw, but it all worked
out in the end, didn't it?

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:51.990
Across the bridge!

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:01.450
Minato...

00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:17.920
The Great Disaster of Sagami Bay.

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:21.180
Twenty years have passed since that day.

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:23.100
It passed in a flash.

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:25.520
Hi, Sana-sensei!

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:28.520
President Maniwa from Osafune Girls' School?

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:33.240
You're Juujou Hiyori and you 
are Etou Kanami, correct?

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:34.610
Yes.

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:38.540
I can still remember that 
day as if it was yesterday.

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:43.370
I am here today because 
of both of your mothers.

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:47.290
Both of us?

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:48.770
That's right.

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:50.430
On the day of the disaster,

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:54.670
three members of our unit headed to 
Okutsumiya to suppress the great aradama.

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:57.550
One of them was my older sister, Yukari.

00:06:58.030 --> 00:07:01.560
Another one was Hiyori-san's 
mother, Hiiragi Kagari.

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:06.810
And the third was Kanami-san's 
mother, Fujiwara Minato.

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:08.940
Eh?!

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:08.940
Oh!

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:08.940
Seriously?

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:11.110
Hiyoyon's mama was Kagarin, and...

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:13.860
Kanami-chan's mother was Minato-san?

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:15.110
Yes.

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:16.660
Why didn't you tell me?!

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:18.710
Well, you didn't ask me.

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:22.450
Besides, Fujiwara is her maiden name. 
She goes by Etou Minato now.

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:25.300
But she's your mother, right?

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:28.080
Didn't you ask her about 
her time as a Toji at all?

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:31.460
My mother never talked about those things.

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:35.210
But I get it now. My mother was a Toji.

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:39.780
Wasn't your mother your first 
sword instructor, Kanami-chan?

00:07:39.780 --> 00:07:43.680
Yeah, she worked me hard 
every day, ever since I was little.

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:46.430
Minato-senpai was really strong.

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:51.150
She was the best I ever knew, and even 
stronger than Origami Yukari at the time.

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:52.560
Is that true?

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:58.320
Yes, Minato-senpai and Kagari-senpai 
were both incredible Toji.

00:07:58.590 --> 00:08:01.920
The real heroes who suppressed 
the great aradama

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:05.330
at the Great Disaster of 
Sagami Bay were your mothers.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:10.710
And we were never able to repay those heroes.

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:15.950
Kanami-chan...

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:21.210
There is something else I need 
to tell you all while we are here.

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:27.350
We have not yet completely vanquished the
great aradama that appeared twenty years ago.

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:32.230
Furthermore, the great aradama has 
gained far more power since then,

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:33.610
and become much stronger.

00:08:34.190 --> 00:08:37.860
We believe that it could cause a great 
disaster like it did twenty years ago

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:39.860
at any time.

00:08:39.860 --> 00:08:43.870
Could that great aradama be 
the one that Kanami-chan saw?

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:46.290
Yes. Princess Tagitsu...

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:49.130
Who is now my older sister, Origami Yukari.

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:03.760
Nee-sama, you're all right!

00:09:07.260 --> 00:09:10.990
Nee-sama, where are Kagari-san and Minato-san?

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:28.950
When the huge aradama that had 
possessed Enoshima disappeared,

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:33.060
the government and the Sword Administration
 declared the incident over.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:37.090
They hid the existence of Prince Tagitsu,
 who was in Okutsumiya.

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:40.000
They concluded that the 
existence of an aradama

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:43.470
with such high intelligence 
would lead to confusion for the masses.

00:09:44.090 --> 00:09:46.850
Of course, that was just the alleged reason.

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:50.870
Since one of the people making that decision

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:52.850
was none other than Origami Yukari herself.

00:09:53.350 --> 00:09:56.450
That is why the tale of the vanquishing 
of the great disaster

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:58.360
that you all know is not the truth.

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:01.840
We were taught in school that it 
was vanquished by the six members

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:05.110
of the special unit consisting of the head of the Origami family, Yukari-sama,

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:07.300
and the current presidents
 of the five schools.

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:10.870
Yes, Hiiragi Kagari and 
Fujiwara Minato's names

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:14.500
were removed from the special unit's roster,
 which should have listed eight members.

00:10:16.710 --> 00:10:18.080
Princess Tagitsu...

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:23.220
She never told us how she suppressed it.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.220
Two years after the great disaster,

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:28.720
Yukari ascended to the head 
of the Origami family.

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:31.100
And those of us in the special unit

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:33.840
were installed as the presidents 
of the five schools,

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:36.600
since we were the heroes of 
the great aradama vanquishing.

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:41.360
Even then, Minato-senpai and 
Kagari-senpai weren't included.

00:10:42.590 --> 00:10:47.860
They both had their lives,
 but they never returned to being Toji.

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:53.620
But they each made a family for themselves, 
and they lived their days in peace.

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:58.880
Shortly thereafter, the Sword Administration

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:03.070
and Special Religious Military Unit 
organizations grew much stronger

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:05.010
under Yukari's control.

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:09.680
As a result, damage by the 
aradama was minimized,

00:11:09.680 --> 00:11:13.170
public opinion improved in polling,
 and new technologies were developed

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:16.300
one after another in cooperation 
with other countries.

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:23.150
But no one realized what was 
left behind twenty years ago.

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:25.400
<b>Spirit Lantern</b>

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:25.400
The significance of the situation...

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:30.910
It was seven years ago when Minato-san 
passed away that I realized the truth.

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:34.340
When she found out that 
Minato-san had passed,

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:38.860
Kagari-san blamed herself, 
saying it was all her fault.

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:44.300
Upon hearing Kagari-san's words,

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:48.550
I was determined to discover the truth 
of the great aradama vanquishing.

00:11:49.130 --> 00:11:52.830
The method that Yukari used 
at the great disaster...

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:58.960
The calming ritual was only passed down to 
a small portion of the Origami family.

00:11:59.590 --> 00:12:03.470
I was able to locate it 
with clues from old books.

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:08.320
That method would have dragged
 Princess Tagitsu into the netherworld

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:12.650
in exchange for the life of Hiiragi Kagari.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:18.830
To the netherworld? In exchange for a life?

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:21.330
Is that even possible?

00:12:21.780 --> 00:12:23.010
It is.

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:25.220
Toji use the power of their okatana,

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:28.350
and use the power of various 
layers of the netherworld,

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:32.690
but rarely, there are those with the power 
to reach the depths of the netherworld.

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:36.100
Kagari-senpai's jin'i was one such power.

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:40.670
Jin'i uses a layer of the netherworld 
to change the flow of time.

00:12:40.670 --> 00:12:42.240
It's an accelerating technique.

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:44.980
The further you dive into it,
 the more you accelerate.

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:49.610
But what do you think happens once 
you reach the theoretical limit?

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:53.370
A moment becomes an eternity 
and time becomes infinite.

00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:56.440
And you won't be able to come back.

00:12:56.440 --> 00:13:02.370
That's right. Kagari-senpai had the 
ability to reach infinity.

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:04.660
Pierce your opponent with your okatana,

00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:07.600
and, theoretically, perform your 
jin'i at the maximum speed.

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:10.900
And then drag your opponent 
into the netherworld.

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:12.050
Goodness...

00:13:12.050 --> 00:13:14.140
A double suicide move, huh?

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:18.920
Kagari-senpai bore the burden of such a duty.

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:21.010
She was prepared from the very beginning

00:13:21.010 --> 00:13:23.520
to give up her own life 
to suppress the aradama.

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:28.160
But Kagari-san survived.

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:32.670
That is because Minato-san just 
barely managed to save her.

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:34.160
My mother did?

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:38.800
Even so, we believe they literally 
shortened their own lives.

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:43.550
They lost their powers as Toji, and 
after some years, they also lost their lives.

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:49.550
Then that was the cause of their passing?

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:51.460
How strange.

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:54.770
If they chased Princess Tagitsu 
back into the netherworld,

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:57.410
then what is Origami Yukari?

00:13:57.410 --> 00:14:00.640
My mother wasn't able to 
suppress the great aradama.

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:03.500
She only took away its power temporarily.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:08.370
It most likely escaped extinction 
by possessing Origami Yukari.

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:12.940
And after twenty years, it is 
trying to revive itself.

00:14:12.940 --> 00:14:16.450
Wait, then what happened 
to who she used to be?

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:18.750
She's been gradually worn 
away by the aradama.

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:19.700
That's right.

00:14:20.030 --> 00:14:23.710
Ever since that day, that thing
 was no longer my sister.

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:30.460
I saw her myself in the hall 
of worship two years ago.

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:34.970
She was talking with 
something lurking inside.

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:40.750
I was convinced that it 
was Princess Tagitsu,

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:44.350
the aradama who was vanquished in the 
great disaster, in the form of Yukari.

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:49.980
I wrote those details down in a letter, 
and implored Kagari-san for her help.

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:49.980
<b>Juujou Kagari-sama</b>

00:14:51.350 --> 00:14:53.740
You have read that letter, haven't you?

00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:06.050
Hiyori-san, Kanami-san, 
here is what I believe...

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:10.430
Had Yukari's plan succeeded 
on that day twenty years ago,

00:15:10.860 --> 00:15:13.760
and Minato-san and Kagari-san not come back,

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:16.260
you two would not be here.

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:19.010
I cannot help but wonder

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:23.770
if it was their true wish that 
you both be here right now.

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:29.120
Myself, along with the members of
 Mokusa here, will do something about Yukari.

00:15:29.710 --> 00:15:30.770
So...

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:36.570
Professor, how's that ampoule coming?

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:40.930
It is being analyzed for now, but it may 
be impossible for our facility to deal with.

00:15:40.930 --> 00:15:44.830
In that case, I would like for you to 
take it to your friends at Osafune.

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:46.110
Understood.

00:15:46.110 --> 00:15:48.320
If the ampoule is what we think it is,

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:50.750
we can finally shed light on the injustices

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:53.090
the Origami family and Renpu 
have been carrying out.

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:54.500
This is the precious thing

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:57.380
my granddaughter and her friends obtained,
 heedless of the dangers.

00:15:57.380 --> 00:15:58.720
I won't let it go to waste.

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:00.800
Please praise me!

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:03.840
All right, good girl, good girl, good girl.

00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:05.310
Hooray!

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:08.700
I'm expecting a bonus for this.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:13.330
The more you succeed,
 the busier I'm going to make you.

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:14.650
Hey...

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:17.710
Chidori and Kogarasumaru were the okatana

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:20.540
each used by Minato-san and 
Kagari-san, respectively.

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:24.280
And now they have been passed 
down to their daughters.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:28.160
<i>Could there be some kind of 
link between these two swords?</i>

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:32.670
Nothing. It was just my imagination.

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:43.590
We only just got here,
 and that was a lot to take in.

00:16:43.590 --> 00:16:46.190
What should I do now?

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:48.810
What? Just act normal.

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:52.110
I can't do anything except fight,

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:54.690
but I want to be useful to everyone.

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:56.650
Sayaka-chan...

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:03.890
Hey, Hiyori-chan.

00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:10.390
It's kind of strange, isn't it?
 Sleeping with everyone like this.

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:13.570
Having obtained that ampoule, 
the members of Mokusa

00:17:13.570 --> 00:17:16.770
might be able to actually make a 
move against the Origami family.

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:21.360
All of these things are the 
result of your actions.

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:25.870
Your hard work wasn't a mistake.

00:17:27.610 --> 00:17:33.340
Kanami, do you really plan to just leave 
it all up to Mokusa like Origami Akane?

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:35.090
I didn't say that.

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:39.990
You two are so noisy! Especially Hiyoyon!

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:40.530
Wha?

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:42.260
Be quiet and go to sleep.

00:17:42.260 --> 00:17:45.150
Our Mokusa senpai are going 
to have us train tomorrow,

00:17:45.150 --> 00:17:46.870
even though we didn't ask for that.

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:49.360
They're really going to work us hard.

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.010
Okay.

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:05.590
I see, you heard all that from Sana.

00:18:05.990 --> 00:18:08.220
So you are my mother from back then.

00:18:08.220 --> 00:18:13.300
But even still, I don't have any 
memories from beyond the age of 17.

00:18:13.300 --> 00:18:17.980
I think your mother was a different me,
 but it's kind of complicated.

00:18:17.980 --> 00:18:19.840
I get it.

00:18:19.840 --> 00:18:23.540
The friend I mentioned before 
is Kagari-san's daughter.

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:24.820
Her name is Hiyori-chan.

00:18:24.820 --> 00:18:27.620
Wow! So Kagari actually got married?

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:29.770
I guess I did too, though.

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:33.200
Hey, you'll have to tell me 
how we got together next time.

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:34.080
Okay.

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:37.710
Oh, but I forget everything 
about this place when I wake up.

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:39.090
I see...

00:18:39.890 --> 00:18:42.710
Does that mean you've forgotten all 
the techniques I've taught you so far?

00:18:42.710 --> 00:18:45.410
My body seems to remember them.

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:47.790
Does it? That's great. What a relief!

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:50.710
Then today, I'll teach you my trump card.

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:52.640
Okay! Please do, Mother!

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:55.520
Stop that! I'm not old enough for that yet.

00:18:55.520 --> 00:18:57.100
Minato, then!

00:18:57.100 --> 00:18:58.500
Master.

00:18:58.500 --> 00:18:59.820
Master Minato!

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:09.820
Hey, what was I like when I was your mom?

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:13.240
You were no different at all!
 Exactly like this!

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:15.590
Figures!

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:17.170
Okay, come at me!

00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:20.820
My mother used to change how she 
held her sword like that, too.

00:19:20.820 --> 00:19:22.820
Is it a habit? Does it have some meaning?

00:19:23.380 --> 00:19:24.800
What, this?

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:29.010
Well, it depends on the situation, 
but you don't need to copy me.

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:36.350
Fighting an aradama requires teamwork.

00:19:36.350 --> 00:19:39.980
Keep a close eye on who's attacking, 
defending, and commanding.

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:41.970
That's enough!

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:42.990
How disappointing.

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:48.280
You're all decent enough on your own,
 but together, you're hopeless.

00:19:48.280 --> 00:19:52.400
If you command the team timidly,
 it will not function.

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:56.010
You can see through things,
 so have confidence in yourself.

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:57.290
Okay...

00:19:57.290 --> 00:20:00.070
Now, what should we do?
 Do you wanna go one more round?

00:20:00.070 --> 00:20:02.690
No, I can't take anymore.

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:03.870
One more please.

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:06.830
Saaya, you're so full of motivation.

00:20:09.010 --> 00:20:12.130
I'm beat. I need water.

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:18.020
That's the S Equipment Ellen-chan and 
Kaoru-chan were wearing before, right?

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:22.470
That kind of equipment didn't exist 
during my mom's time, did it.

00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:23.590
If it did...

00:20:23.590 --> 00:20:27.100
You think your mothers 
might not have passed away?

00:20:28.110 --> 00:20:30.330
Fine—Friedman.

00:20:31.820 --> 00:20:35.620
Though they can use special 
powers like utsushi and jin'i,

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:38.230
Toji are still just girls.

00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:41.370
The number of Toji saved by 
this technology will increase.

00:20:41.980 --> 00:20:44.700
That's not the only benefit 
of the netherworld technology.

00:20:45.150 --> 00:20:48.930
The world as we know it will change 
completely as development progresses.

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:52.370
Just like in my native country, 
there are many people who think

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:55.630
they want this technology, even if 
they have to enter another person's property.

00:20:56.070 --> 00:21:00.520
But why did Origami Yukari 
bring about this technology?

00:21:00.520 --> 00:21:03.980
I study this technology every day.

00:21:03.980 --> 00:21:08.720
Because I thought that I could figure out 
Origami Yukari's motivation that way.

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:13.020
And once I did find it,
 I came to a simple conclusion.

00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:16.470
It seemed to me that it 
was just a way for Toji

00:21:16.470 --> 00:21:20.950
to effectively hunt aradama 
and to quickly recover noro.

00:21:20.950 --> 00:21:26.290
Developing this technology is no more
 than making tea to her.

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:33.260
The opponent we are trying to face 
now isn't just an ordinary aradama.

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:36.300
She may be more like a god.

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:44.060
Well, then, I will report in once we 
are finished analyzing it at Osafune.

00:21:44.470 --> 00:21:47.860
Please do, and take care of yourself.

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:49.010
You, too.

00:22:01.740 --> 00:22:03.870
I've found you, Akane.

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:39.800
<b>Next Episode  After the Festival</b>
